0000:                   * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
0000:                   ********************************************************************
0000:                   * KMode - select the Japanese character encoding of the terminal
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Usage: kmode [off|utf8|euc|sjis]
0000:                   *
0000:                   * The SCF line editor (os9/kanji/scf.asm) erases a whole multibyte
0000:                   * character, and echoes the erase sequence once per display column,
0000:                   * depending on PD.PAR of the path:
0000:                   *      0 off   1 UTF-8   2 EUC-JP   3 Shift_JIS (CP932)
0000:                   * Without an argument the current setting is shown.
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Part of the MC6809/OS-9 simulator (see README).
0000:                   ********************************************************************
0000:                   
0000:                            nam   KMode
0000:                            ttl   Japanese terminal encoding
0000:                   
0000:                            ifp1
0000:                            use   defsfile
0000:                            endc
0000:                   
0011:                   tylg     set   Prgrm+Objct
0081:                   atrv     set   ReEnt+rev
0001:                   rev      set   $01
0001:                   edition  set   1
0000:                   
0014:                   PAROFS   equ   PD.PAR-PD.OPT
